  "description": "XbyK runtime module for Sentinel for Xperience by Kentico. Installs into your XbyK 31.x site and runs the Sentinel check suite on a configurable schedule. Writes findings to CMS_EventLog, persists scan history in custom Kentico-managed tables, sends HTML email digests via the built-in email service, and exposes a \"Contact Refined Element\" channel for fixed-price remediation quotes. Complements the CLI (XperienceCommunity.Sentinel) for devs who want on-demand scans. Community project — not affiliated with or maintained by Kentico.",
